1) Register — Đăng ký user
-   Method: POST
-   URL: POST {{base_url}}/api/auth/register
-   Body (JSON):
    {
        "username": "alice",
        "email": "alice@example.com",
        "password": "secret123",
        "roles": ["ROLE_USER"]    
    }
-   Response 200 OK:
    {
        "id": "607d1f...",
        "username": "alice",
        "email": "alice@example.com",
        "roles": ["ROLE_USER"],
        "createdAt": "2026-01-25T12:30:10Z",
        "lastLogin": null
    }
-   400 Bad Request — validation lỗi (thiếu field, email invalid, username exists, ...)